<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Equities said downgraded Cabletron Systems Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cabletron Systems said Monday that it expects to report first-quarter earnings per share of about $0.37, compared with the First Call consensus estimate of $0.50 per share.</p>
<p>-- FAC Equities said it expects fiscal 1998 earnings estimates to be in the range of $1.60 to $1.70 a share and 1999 estimates to be &quot;at the $2.00 level.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Cabletron lost 15-1/2 to 30-1/4.</p>
</text>
